      "writtenOn": "2024-05-15T21:13:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "are all of those configs really needed for your device? Are any of them tristate and can be built as a module instead of built into the kernel?",
      "parentUuid": "a8ba483f_f2f90388",
      "revId": "a3506cf08426bfd2ea2e5bcf57eda7889be8ec57",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
